# Ignored files copied into each new worktree (works with Orca).
#
# Deliberately NOT listed: /.env and apps/api/.env. On a machine that also runs
# production they hold the production database URL and secrets, and the test
# suite deletes whole tables. Each worktree's apps/api/.env is written by
# `node scripts/orca/worktree.mjs setup`, pointing at that worktree's own database.
# .env.test is tracked, so it needs no entry.
#
# Only add files that hold development-only values.
.vscode/settings.json
